        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINCOVCOM, Windsor Entryset with Coventry Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Entryset with Glass Coventry Knob has a neoclassical design that makes it ideal for colonial style homes. The Windsor Entryset with Coventry Knob manages to look historic with a modern twist. The Coventry Knob is made out of black glass, and it is that detail which updates the entire front door lock. This Single Cylinder Entrance Set is beautiful and is available in several finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Windsor Plate with Coventry Knob and Single Cylinder Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-WINCOVCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur WINCOVCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
