                "title": "Windsor Entryset with Glass Coventry Knob",
                "description": "The Windsor Entryset with Glass Coventry Knob has a neoclassical design that makes it ideal for colonial style homes. The Windsor Entryset with Coventry Knob manages to look historic with a modern twist. The Coventry Knob is made out of black glass, and it is that detail which updates the entire front door lock. This Single Cylinder Entrance Set is beautiful and is available in several finishes.",
